              "content": "# Keyboard Shortcut List\n\nA complete reference of keyboard shortcuts available in Writing Shed Pro. Works on Mac and iPad with external keyboard.\n\n## File Operations\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘N | New file |\n| ⌘S | Force save/sync |\n| ⌘W | Close file |\n\n## Edit Operations\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘Z | Undo |\n| ⌘⇧Z | Redo |\n| ⌘X | Cut |\n| ⌘C | Copy |\n| ⌘V | Paste |\n| ⌘A | Select all |\n| ⌫ (Delete) | Delete selection or character left |\n| ⌦ (Forward Delete) | Delete character right |\n\n## Text Formatting\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘B | Bold |\n| ⌘I | Italic |\n| ⌘U | Underline |\n\n## Styles\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘⌥0 | Apply Body style |\n| ⌘⌥1 | Apply Heading 1 |\n| ⌘⌥2 | Apply Heading 2 |\n| ⌘⌥3 | Apply Heading 3 |\n\n## Find and Replace\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘F | Open Find |\n| ⌘G | Find next |\n| ⌘⇧G | Find previous |\n| ⌘⌥F | Open Find and Replace |\n| Esc | Close Find/Replace |\n\n## Navigation\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘↑ | Go to document start |\n| ⌘↓ | Go to document end |\n| ⌘← | Go to line start |\n| ⌘→ | Go to line end |\n| ⌥← | Move word left |\n| ⌥→ | Move word right |\n| ⌥↑ | Move paragraph up |\n| ⌥↓ | Move paragraph down |\n| ⇞ (Page Up) | Scroll up one screen |\n| ⇟ (Page Down) | Scroll down one screen |\n\n## Selection\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⇧ + any arrow | Extend selection in that direction |\n| ⌘⇧← | Select to line start |\n| ⌘⇧→ | Select to line end |\n| ⌘⇧↑ | Select to document start |\n| ⌘⇧↓ | Select to document end |\n| ⌥⇧← | Select word left |\n| ⌥⇧→ | Select word right |\n| ⌥⇧↑ | Select paragraph up |\n| ⌥⇧↓ | Select paragraph down |\n| ⌘A | Select all |\n\n## Zoom\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘+ or ⌘= | Zoom in |\n| ⌘- | Zoom out |\n| ⌘0 | Reset zoom to 100% |\n\n## Text Entry\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| Return | New paragraph |\n| ⇧Return | Line break (soft return) |\n| Tab | Insert tab (in code/tables) |\n| ⌘⇧C | Insert comment |\n\n## Lists and Indentation\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| Tab | Increase list indent (create sub-list) |\n| ⇧Tab | Decrease list indent (promote item) |\n\n**Notes:**\n- Tab/Shift+Tab work when cursor is in a list item\n- Sub-lists use different numbering: 1→a→i for numbers, •→◦→▪ for bullets  \n- Sub-list numbering restarts when you return to a higher level\n- Shift+Tab at Level 1 exits the list (applies Body style)\n\n## Gestures (Touch)\n\n### iPhone\n| Gesture | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| Shake | Undo |\n| Three-finger swipe left | Undo |\n| Three-finger swipe right | Redo |\n| Double-tap word | Select word |\n| Triple-tap | Select paragraph |\n\n### iPad\n| Gesture | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| Three-finger swipe left | Undo |\n| Three-finger swipe right | Redo |\n| Double-tap word | Select word |\n| Triple-tap | Select paragraph |\n| Pinch | Zoom in/out |\n| Two-finger tap | Secondary click (context menu) |\n\n### Mac (Trackpad)\n| Gesture | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| Two-finger tap | Secondary click |\n| Pinch | Zoom in/out |\n| Force click | Look up definition |\n\n## Quick Reference Card\n\nCut this out and keep it handy:\n\n```\nESSENTIALS\n⌘Z Undo    ⌘⇧Z Redo    ⌘F Find\n⌘B Bold    ⌘I Italic   ⌘U Underline\n⌘C Copy    ⌘V Paste    ⌘X Cut\n\nNAVIGATION\n⌘↑ Top     ⌘↓ Bottom\n⌥← Word left    ⌥→ Word right\n\nZOOM\n⌘+ In     ⌘- Out     ⌘0 Reset\n```\n\n## Key Symbol Legend\n\n| Symbol | Key Name |\n|--------|----------|\n| ⌘ | Command |\n| ⌥ | Option (Alt) |\n| ⇧ | Shift |\n| ⌃ | Control |\n| ⌫ | Delete (Backspace) |\n| ⌦ | Forward Delete |\n| ↩ | Return |\n| ⎋ | Escape |\n| ⇞ | Page Up |\n| ⇟ | Page Down |\n| ↑↓←→ | Arrow keys |\n\n## See Also\n- [Keyboard Shortcuts](../10-advanced-features/05-keyboard-shortcuts.md)\n- [The Editor](../04-writing/01-the-editor.md)\n\n---\n",
              "createdDate": "2026-02-04T09:20:04Z",
              "footnotes": [],
              "id": "F7B10B1C-F45D-44C4-9E2A-23D3A4904CE9",
