          "currentVersionIndex": 0,
          "id": "BF5A89FC-3D6B-4A66-B416-85B0BF81E0FB",
          "includedInManuscript": true,
          "modifiedDate": "2026-02-03T15:35:27Z",
          "name": "105-keyboard-shortcuts",
          "sectionId": "1A4A60D7-55FE-49AF-9636-75122540D6B9",
          "userOrder": 4,
          "versions": [
            {
              "comments": [],
              "content": "# Keyboard Shortcuts\n\nWriting Shed Pro supports keyboard shortcuts for faster navigation and editing. These work on Mac and iPad with an external keyboard.\n\n## Viewing All Shortcuts\n\nOn iPad with keyboard:\n- Press and hold **⌘** (Command) to see available shortcuts for the current screen\n\nOn Mac:\n- Shortcuts appear in menus next to commands\n- Hold ⌘ for context-specific shortcuts\n\n## Essential Shortcuts\n\n### File Operations\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘N | New file |\n| ⌘S | Save (auto-saves, but forces sync) |\n| ⌘W | Close file |\n\n### Edit Operations\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘Z | Undo |\n| ⌘⇧Z | Redo |\n| ⌘X | Cut |\n| ⌘C | Copy |\n| ⌘V | Paste |\n| ⌘A | Select all |\n\n### Text Formatting\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘B | Bold |\n| ⌘I | Italic |\n| ⌘U | Underline |\n\n### Find and Replace\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘F | Find |\n| ⌘G | Find next |\n| ⌘⇧G | Find previous |\n| ⌘⌥F | Find and replace |\n\n### Navigation\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘↑ | Go to document start |\n| ⌘↓ | Go to document end |\n| ⌘← | Go to line start |\n| ⌘→ | Go to line end |\n| ⌥← | Move word left |\n| ⌥→ | Move word right |\n\n### Selection\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⇧ + arrow | Extend selection |\n| ⌘⇧← | Select to line start |\n| ⌘⇧→ | Select to line end |\n| ⌘⇧↑ | Select to document start |\n| ⌘⇧↓ | Select to document end |\n| ⌥⇧← | Select word left |\n| ⌥⇧→ | Select word right |\n\n### Zoom\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘+ | Zoom in |\n| ⌘- | Zoom out |\n| ⌘0 | Reset zoom |\n\n## Text Insertion Shortcuts\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| ⌘⇧C | Insert comment (if available) |\n| Return | New paragraph |\n| ⇧Return | Line break (within paragraph) |\n\n## Special Keys\n\n### Common Modifier Keys\n- **⌘** (Command): Primary modifier\n- **⌥** (Option/Alt): Secondary modifier\n- **⇧** (Shift): Extend selection or alternate action\n- **⌃** (Control): Additional options\n\n### Function Keys (if keyboard has them)\nMay be available for custom actions.\n\n## Platform Differences\n\n### iPad with External Keyboard\n- Most shortcuts work\n- Some Mac-specific shortcuts may differ\n- Hold ⌘ to see available options\n\n### Mac\n- Full keyboard support\n- Menu bar shows shortcuts\n- System shortcuts also available\n\n### iPhone\nNo hardware keyboard typically, but Bluetooth keyboards work similarly to iPad.\n\n## Customizing Shortcuts\n\nCurrently, shortcuts are not customizable. The defaults follow Apple's standard patterns.\n\n## Learning Shortcuts\n\n### Start with the Essentials\nLearn these first:\n1. ⌘B/I/U (formatting)\n2. ⌘Z (undo)\n3. ⌘F (find)\n4. ⌘C/V (copy/paste)\n\n### Build from There\nAdd shortcuts as you need them. Muscle memory develops over time.\n\n### Print a Reference\nSee [Keyboard Shortcut List](../11-reference/01-keyboard-shortcut-list.md) for a printable list.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Shortcut Not Working\n- Check correct keys pressed\n- Some shortcuts are context-sensitive\n- Feature may not be available in current view\n\n### Wrong Action Happening\n- May be conflicting with system shortcut\n- Check the intended shortcut\n- Report bugs if shortcuts behave unexpectedly\n\n## See Also\n- [Keyboard Shortcut List](../11-reference/01-keyboard-shortcut-list.md)\n- [The Editor](../04-writing/01-the-editor.md)\n- [The Interface Tour](../02-getting-started/03-the-interface-tour.md)\n\n---\n",
              "createdDate": "2026-02-03T15:32:41Z",
              "footnotes": [],
              "id": "707F6634-D539-4A64-8478-4C0399A07F26",
              "versionNumber": 1
            }
          ],
          "workflowStatus": "ready"
        },
        {
          "contentTypeRaw": "markdown",
