          "userOrder": 4,
          "versions": [
            {
              "comments": [],
              "content": "# Application Settings\n\nWriting Shed Pro's Settings screen gives you quick access to app-wide features, import tools, appearance options, and support. Open it by tapping the **gear icon** (⚙) in the toolbar on the project list screen.\n\n## General\n\n### About Writing Shed Pro\nView version information, build number, and credits.\n\n### Manage Purchases\nReview and restore your in-app purchases. If you've reinstalled the app or switched devices, use this to restore previous purchases.\n\n### Stylesheet Editor\nOpen the stylesheet editor to create and customise stylesheets for your documents. Stylesheets control fonts, sizes, spacing, and other formatting when you export or print. See [Stylesheet Editor](../10-tools/102-stylesheet-editor.md) for details.\n\n## Import\n\n### Import\nImport a `.wsp` file — a Writing Shed Pro project archive. Choose the file from your device or iCloud Drive, and it will be added to your project list. See [Export Options](../9-export/91-export-options.md) for details on the WSP format.\n\n### Import User Guide\nImport the Writing Shed Pro User Guide as a project in your project list. This creates a fully browsable copy of the guide that you can read alongside your own work.\n\n## Appearance (iPhone and iPad only)\n\nChoose how Writing Shed Pro's interface appears:\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **System** | Follows your device's light/dark mode setting |\n| **Light Mode** | Always uses a light background |\n| **Dark Mode** | Always uses a dark background |\n\n> **Note**: On Mac, Writing Shed Pro follows your system appearance automatically. The Appearance section is not shown on Mac.\n\n## Support\n\n### Sync Diagnostics\nView the status of iCloud sync and troubleshoot any issues. This shows details about your sync container, pending operations, and recent sync activity. See [iCloud Sync](24-icloud-sync.md) for more about sync.\n\n### Reset All Tips\nResets all popover tips and inline tips so they appear again as you use the app. Use this if you dismissed a tip early and want to see it again.\n\n### Contact Support\nSend a message to the Writing Shed Pro support team. This opens a pre-filled email with your app version and device information included, helping us assist you more quickly.\n\n### Rate This App\nIf you're enjoying Writing Shed Pro, tapping this opens the App Store rating dialog so you can leave a review. Your feedback helps other writers discover the app.\n\n## See Also\n- [The Interface Tour](23-the-interface-tour.md)\n- [iCloud Sync](24-icloud-sync.md)\n- [Stylesheet Editor](../10-tools/102-stylesheet-editor.md)\n- [Export Options](../9-export/91-export-options.md)\n\n---\n",
