          "name": "121-version-history",
          "sectionId": "2103AD26-822D-4FD1-A157-653EF6E2FCFC",
          "versions": [
            {
              "comments": [],
              "content": "# Version History\n\nA record of Writing Shed Pro releases and their major changes.\n\n## Current Version\n\n### Version 1.0\n**Release Date**: 2025\n\nThe initial public release of Writing Shed Pro.\n\n**Features**:\n- Four project types: Prose, Poetry, Fiction, Drama\n- iCloud sync across devices\n- iOS/iPadOS 17+ and macOS 14+ support\n- Full-featured text editor\n- Stylesheet customization\n- PDF and RTF export\n- Poetry tools: syllable counting, rhyme detection, verse highlighting\n- Fiction tools: chapters, scenes, plot tracking\n- Drama tools: DML script formatting\n- Collections for organizing work\n- Submission tracking for publications\n- Comments and footnotes\n- Word count and statistics\n- Keyboard shortcuts for Mac and iPad\n\n## Future Versions\n\nUpdates will be documented here as they're released.\n\n---\n\n## Understanding Version Numbers\n\nWriting Shed Pro uses semantic versioning:\n\n**Major.Minor.Patch**\n\n- **Major**: Significant new features or changes\n- **Minor**: New features, backward compatible\n- **Patch**: Bug fixes and small improvements\n\nExample: Version 1.2.3\n- Major version: 1\n- Minor version: 2\n- Patch version: 3\n\n## Checking Your Version\n\n### On iPhone/iPad\n1. Open Writing Shed Pro\n2. Go to Settings\n3. Scroll to About or Version\n\n### On Mac\n1. Open Writing Shed Pro\n2. Menu: Writing Shed Pro → About\n\n## Updating the App\n\n### Automatic Updates\nEnable automatic updates in App Store settings to always have the latest version.\n\n### Manual Update\n1. Open the App Store\n2. Search for Writing Shed Pro\n3. If an update is available, tap Update\n\n## See Also\n- [What's New](../1-welcome/12-whats-new.md)\n- [Contact Support](../11-reference/05-contact-support.md)\n\n---\n",
              "createdDate": "2026-02-09T12:46:49Z",
              "footnotes": [],
              "id": "390413DB-EEAD-4539-9C16-C919F644397A",
              "versionNumber": 1
            }
          ],
          "workflowStatus": "ready"
        },
        {
          "contentTypeRaw": "markdown",
